Feels like X-COM + Battle Brothers
Pros:
 - atmospheric;
 - lots of skills/weapon/oil combo builds to experiment with;
 - detailed map, interesting to explore;
 - good progression system;
 - tons of content;
Cons:
 - same problem as in X-COM - maxed-out characters become so OP that they can almost solo kill enemy's party (my maxed-out pugilist solo'ed Sven);
 - inventory management is frustrating sometimes - even after depositing unnecessary stuff to the storage, you still need to carry tons of items with you;

Overall, can recommend

